<title>USA: Bedford CSD, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Bedford CSD, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it won $2.100 million of Bedford Central School District, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.27 percent.</p>
